\description{
The package's main entry point (AGENTS.md Section 6). Looks up a pre-trained
\link[=PhaseReferenceModel-class]{PhaseReferenceModel} for the requested \verb{(species, tissue, method, platform)} -
see \code{\link[=availableReferenceModels]{availableReferenceModels()}} for what is currently bundled - predicts phase
with that engine's own \code{predict} function, attaches a circular confidence
interval built from the reference model's real held-out residual pool (no live
bootstrap refit at call time - see \link[=PhaseReferenceModel-class]{PhaseReferenceModel}), a core-clock
